<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Booking Confirmed - TeleHealings</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #f5f5f5; }
    .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; }
    .header { background-color: #27AE60; padding: 32px 40px; text-align: center; }
    .header h1 { color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 600; }
    .content { padding: 40px; }
    .greeting { font-size: 18px; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 16px; }
    .message { font-size: 15px; color: #555555; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .details-box { background-color: #f0faf4; border-left: 4px solid #27AE60; padding: 20px; margin-bottom: 24px; border-radius: 0 6px 6px 0; }
    .detail-row { margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 14px; color: #333333; }
    .detail-label { font-weight: 600; color: #666666; display: inline-block; width: 120px; }
    .footer { padding: 24px 40px; border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; color: #999999; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>Booking Confirmed</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="content">
      <p class="greeting">Hi {{name}},</p>
      <p class="message">
        Your therapy session has been successfully booked. Here are the details:
      </p>
      <div class="details-box">
        <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Therapist:</span> {{therapistName}}</div>
        <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Date:</span> {{sessionDate}}</div>
        <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Time:</span> {{sessionTime}}</div>
        <div class="detail-row"><span class="detail-label">Type:</span> {{sessionType}}</div>
      </div>
      <p class="message">
        You will receive a reminder before your session. If you need to reschedule, please do so at least 24 hours in advance.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; 2026 TeleHealings. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
